  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS 9948 PPG Support for the development of a national policy, institutional and monitoring framework to effectively implement the Nagoya Protocol in Belize</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Support for the development of a national policy, institutional and monitoring framework to effectively implement the Nagoya Protocol in Belize. As described in the project concept, the goal of this project is not only to create the enabling environment for the country&#x2019;s accession to the &#x201c;Nagoya Protocol on Access to Genetic Resources and the Fair and Equitable Sharing of Benefits Arising from their Utilization&#x201d;,</narrative>
  </description>
